-- Witness migration: intentionally changes nothing. Its presence bumps the
-- schema version 8 -> 9 so the one-time orphan sweep (migrations/8.kt, gated
-- on boundary 8) runs exactly once on every database already at version 8,
-- not only on databases upgrading from older schemas. Fresh installs are
-- created at version 9 and skip the sweep.
SELECT 1 WHERE 0;
